WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.264
On the train or on a plane, the connection
comes and goes.

00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:05.352
You still want to see what is on your
list.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:10.823
Merkzettel keeps a local copy of all your
lists.

00:00:11.123 --> 00:00:14.618
It starts without a network, and a banner
tells you that you are offline.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.520
Lists, tasks, steps, notes and categories
are all there.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.614
Search, sorting and My Day work offline,
too.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.103
Changing tasks needs a connection.

00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:37.470
Merkzettel does not queue changes
silently.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.767
It tells you when something could not be
saved.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:49.007
Back online, Merkzettel reconnects by
itself, or you choose Reconnect.

00:00:49.307 --> 00:00:51.745
Then it fetches everything that changed in
the meantime.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:59.763
A tip for the road: open the All list once
before you leave.

00:01:00.063 --> 00:01:01.851
It updates every list at once.

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:08.057
That is how Merkzettel works offline.

